Dear {!Contact.FirstName}, <br /><br />

Your request to be classified as an Arizona resident for tuition purposes for the &lt;&lt; TERM &gt;&gt; has been approved. Your classification has been changed to resident and you will see this reflected on your <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/" target="_blank">My ASU</a> page.  <br /><br />

Questions regarding your tuition balance and/or refunds should be directed to Student Business Services at 480-965-6341.<br /><br />

Changes to residency can affect financial aid and the amount of assistance you receive may decrease as a result of this change. Please contact Financial Aid and Scholarship Services at 480-965-3355 if you have questions about your award(s). If your financial aid is reduced, you will notified by email and instructed to view your <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/" target="_blank">My ASU</a> page for details.<br /><br /> 

The Residency Classification Office can be reached via email at <a href="mailto:residencydocs@asu.edu?Subject=Questions%20For%20the%20Residency%20Classification%20Office" target="_top">residencydocs@asu.edu</a> or by calling 480-965-7712.<br /><br />


Sincerely, <br />
 {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}<br><br>
                    

